S652 THM-410 / Square-Blowup Enumeration Speedups
========================================================================

Thesis: enumeration gets faster when the quotient remembers the
witness carrier.  THM-410 remembers reversed intervals; square-node
substitution remembers modules.  Forget either carrier and the task
falls back toward raw edge masks or raw S_N canonicalization.

